  "input": "What was the deploy window for the scheduler before it changed?\n[2025-10-27] standup/dune/2025-10-27-2: New deploy window for scheduler: on weekday mornings before 11:00 UTC. Forget the previous weekdays after 15:00 UTC slot. [2026-02-23] standup/dune/2026-02-23: The job scheduler deploy window (unchanged): on weekday mornings before 11:00 UTC. [2026-04-16] standup/ember/2026-04-16: The ledger service's deploy window changes today: it is now on Mondays and Wednesdays between 14:00 and 16:00 UTC. The old slot (Wednesdays 09:00-11:00 UTC) is retired.",
